{
 "file": "EN/EVENT_DATA/MESSAGE/E500/E511_570.BMD",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "MSG_000_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Maruki",
   "en": "Thank you for coming.",
   "uk": "Дякую, що прийшли.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_001_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Maruki",
   "en": "...It looks like I have your answer.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_002_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "It's time to finish this.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_002_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "We're sure of ourselves now.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_002_0_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'm sorry.",
   "uk": "Вибачте.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_003_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Maruki",
   "en": "Indeed... No more hesitation.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_004_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Maruki",
   "en": "That's good to hear. Now...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Maruki",
   "en": "Don't apologize...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Maruki",
   "en": "All this means is that we both have[n]something we can't allow to fail.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_006_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Maruki",
   "en": "Let's begin.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Maruki",
   "en": "If you win, my heart will be changed...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Maruki",
   "en": "However, if I win... My reality becomes[n]the true reality. I will overwrite all of[n]existence with my own cognition.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#2",
   "speaker": "Maruki",
   "en": "I'm not holding back anymore.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_008_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Wh-What the...?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_009_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Maruki",
   "en": "Just as you have your own beliefs,[n]I too have no intention of changing[n]my plans for reality.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_009_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Maruki",
   "en": "No matter what happens to me in the[n]end, I will fix this torturous world!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_009_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Maruki",
   "en": "That... is my own rebellion!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_010_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Yusuke",
   "en": "His apparel just...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_011_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Maruki",
   "en": "And I believe you called forth your[n]power like this:",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_012_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Maruki",
   "en": "Persona.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_013_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "No way...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_013_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "So Maruki really does have a Persona!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_013_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Maruki",
   "en": "I'd regret not pointing this out to you...[n]You shouldn't mistake our powers as[n]being equal.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_014_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Maruki",
   "en": "It's time, Azathoth...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_014_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Maruki",
   "en": "Our final battle has come.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  }
 ]
}